#: ../../source/guide/tools.md:3 29cad7f767a747679047b9c66ff6a034
msgid ""
"v4.0.0 界面接通的计算工具只有**轨道族生成**（orbit_family_generation）。 参数面板由工具的 JSON "
"Schema 自动生成：字段范围、默认值与说明来自 e2m2e 的 Pydantic 模型；按 `orbit_type` "
"裁剪，只显示当前族适用的字段；Optional 字段 以勾选控制传不传值（勾选即传、不勾视为未设置）。"
msgstr "The only computation tool wired into the v4.0.0 UI is **orbit family generation** (orbit_family_generation). The parameter panel is generated from the tool's JSON Schema: field ranges, defaults and descriptions come from e2m2e's Pydantic models; the form is pruned by `orbit_type` so only the fields applicable to the current family are shown; Optional fields are controlled by checkboxes (checked = send the value, unchecked = unset)."

#: ../../source/guide/tools.md:8 e22d481901e1437c8b016adcd482f763
msgid "轨道族生成（orbit_family_generation）"
msgstr "Orbit Family Generation (orbit_family_generation)"

#: ../../source/guide/tools.md:10 b9774303577a41c8835e6a2cd1285663
msgid ""
"在 CR3BP 中生成轨道族：周期族（Halo / NRHO / Axial / SPO / LPO / Horseshoe） "
"为延拓，Lissajous 为拟周期轨迹的参数采样，DRO 为月心族（不绑定平动点）。 范围与默认值由 e2m2e "
"`FamilyGenerationRequest` 的 `valid_ranges` 决定，GUI 不另维护一份。纯 CR3BP 计算，不需要 "
"SPICE 内核。"
msgstr "Generates orbit families in the CR3BP: periodic families (Halo / NRHO / Axial / SPO / LPO / Horseshoe) by continuation, Lissajous by parameter sampling of quasi-periodic bounded trajectories, DRO as a Moon-centred family (not bound to a libration point). Ranges and defaults come from the e2m2e `FamilyGenerationRequest` `valid_ranges`; the GUI keeps no copy of its own. Pure CR3BP computation — no SPICE kernels needed."

